Phase 11 — Honest scale

In: Published TPS and p95 from Locust against /v1/payments.
Out: Invented 1M TPS.
Done when: measured p95 is published.

Phase 12 (cloud) is deferred. Do not start it from this branch.

Implementation: Locust POSTs /v1/payments (human, unique keys). payment-load
writes load/last-run.json and load/MEASURED.md. This run measured 213.10 TPS
and p95 38.0 ms at 6 users for 20s. Not 1M TPS. 100ms p95 is not a contract.
